#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:108
msgid "More Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Plus de questions fréquentes"

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:114
msgid "Do I need a permit for tree removal?"
msgstr "Ai-je besoin d'un permis pour l'abattage d'arbres ?"

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:117
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In many municipalities in Luxembourg, tree removal requires a permit.I am "
#| "happy to advise you on local regulations and help with theapplication "
#| "process."
msgid ""
"In many municipalities in Luxembourg, tree removal requires a permit. I am "
"happy to advise you on local regulations and help with the application "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Dans de nombreuses communes au Luxembourg, l'abattage d'arbresnécessite un "
"permis. Je suis heureux de vous conseiller sur lesréglementations locales et "
"de vous aider dans la procédure de demande."

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:123
msgid "What is the difference between tree care and tree inspection?"
msgstr ""
"Quelle est la différence entre l'entretien des arbres et le contrôledes "
"arbres ?"

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:126
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Tree inspection is the systematic examination of a tree for damageand "
#| "traffic safety. Tree care includes active measures such aspruning, "
#| "deadwood removal, and crown correction."
msgid ""
"Tree inspection is the systematic examination of a tree for damage and "
"traffic safety. Tree care includes active measures such as pruning, deadwood "
"removal, and crown correction."
msgstr ""
"Le contrôle des arbres est l'examen systématique d'un arbre pourdétecter les "
"dommages et évaluer la sécurité routière. L'entretiendes arbres comprend des "
"mesures actives telles que la taille,l'élimination du bois mort et la "
"correction de la couronne."

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:132
msgid "How often should a tree be inspected?"
msgstr "À quelle fréquence un arbre doit-il être contrôlé ?"

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:135
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "For trees in high-traffic locations, the FLL recommends annualinspection. "
#| "For less frequented locations, a longer interval may besufficient."
msgid ""
"For trees in high-traffic locations, the FLL recommends annual inspection. "
"For less frequented locations, a longer interval may be sufficient."
msgstr ""
"Pour les arbres situés dans des endroits à forte circulation, la "
"FLLrecommande un contrôle annuel. Pour les endroits moins fréquentés, "
"unintervalle plus long peut être suffisant."

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:141
msgid "Do you dispose of the cuttings?"
msgstr "Éliminez-vous les déchets de coupe ?"

#: .\arborist\templates\arborist\faq.html:144
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Yes, upon request I dispose of the cuttings properly. Alternatively,they "
#| "can remain on-site, e.g., as wood chips for your garden beds."
msgid ""
"Yes, upon request I dispose of the cuttings properly. Alternatively, they "
"can remain on-site, e.g., as wood chips for your garden beds."
msgstr ""
"Oui, sur demande, j'élimine correctement les déchets de coupe. Ilspeuvent "
"également rester sur place, par exemple sous forme de copeauxde bois pour "
"vos plates-bandes."

